'''Commuter Life''' (出張辞令, ''Shucchō Jirei'', '''Business Trip Resignation''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

